{"thread":{"threadID":4448,"boardID":166,"topic":"TTT_Closequarters_beta","time":1493392763,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","lastPostTime":1493876016,"lastPoster":"Mike","replies":16,"views":662,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[{"tagID":235,"name":"map"},{"tagID":1134,"name":"new rewards"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"}],"posts":[{"postID":65397,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"TTT_Closequarters_beta","time":1493392763,"lastEditTime":1493854627,"editCount":4,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2615,"editor":"Damon","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey there guys!<br>I&#x27;ve made a new TTT Map and would love to test it on the server later on.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Here it is:<br><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/195235\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">ttt_closequarters</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65399,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493399560,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Can you join our Teamspeak server? We are just testing the map right now.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65400,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493400407,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sure what room are you in?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65401,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493401253,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1493403005,"value":1},{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1493404361,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1493408247,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1493474372,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1493567495,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wurde durch mich und <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> ausführlich getestet und für gut befunden. Bitte <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> auf den Server aufspielen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Our Suggestion:<br>- Windows in T-Room are so thick that you cant shoot through them. Maybe wait for Players to give feedback.<br>- No special guns in T-Room</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Our Opinion:<br>- As map name says, it is close quarters. We dont have much of those maps so it would be a good addition to our mappool<br>- Nice design<br>- enough weapons for all players<br>- Potential for good modifications in later versions</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65414,"threadID":4448,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1493474693,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1493481300,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>hello <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2615-damon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Damon</a><br>your map looks pretty good and promising I would love to see it on TTT server .<br>thanks for your time and your Suggestions .</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65425,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493492500,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Any news regarding the map? Is it on the server yet?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65428,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493492693,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1493497806,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1493567387,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sorry not yet. In progress</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65435,"threadID":4448,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1493553749,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","time":1493556603,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1493567392,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1493570040,"value":1},{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1493591990,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I&#x27;ll put the map on the server this evening.<br>Thanks for suggesting it.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65446,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493579384,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>T-Door wont open</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65454,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493591982,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hmm I see, does any other maps with t rooms work on the server? Might be something I did wrong but I&#x27;m not sure.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65455,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493592661,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>all the maps from &quot;princess&quot; like princesscraft_v4 or &quot;ttt_princess_vertigo&quot;</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65464,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493634710,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Alright I think I might have a way to fix it but I can&#x27;t test it locally so would need to test on a server with ttt installed</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65465,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493635443,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Maxbe you can contact <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> and test it on our test server.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65490,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493740676,"lastEditTime":1493762287,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2615,"editor":"Damon","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Could you test this version on the server? <a href=\"http://www.filedropper.com/tttclosequarterstest_1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Download</a><br>This version also has 2 buttons for T&#x27;s to use inside the T rooms to kill people.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>this is called ttt_closequarters_test<br>and should work on your server. Let me know</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65491,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493762340,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1493820612,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Updated again. Me and Mike tried it and it didnt work properly. However I redid the system and changed it too be very very similiar to princesscraft so it should work now.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Here it is:<br><a href=\"http://www.filedropper.com/tttclosequarterstest_1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Download</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65528,"threadID":4448,"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","subject":"","time":1493854603,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Stable version released.<br>Now works perfectly on your server.<br>The name of the stable release is simply ttt_closequarters.<br>Don&#x27;t rename it as this is the version that is going to be used normally now.<br>Thanks for testing with me guys!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Stable version:<br><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/195235\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Download</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":65530,"threadID":4448,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1493876016,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2615,"username":"Damon","time":1493893172,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Closed. further updates can be sent to us.</p>","polls":[]}]}